OL,3,GNEWSABurglar jailed after CCTV linked
OL,4,Ahim to crime spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar has been jailed after CCTV
OL,7,Fcaptured him raiding businesses in a
OL,8,Fseries of disguises.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said Shawn Tulley
OL,11,Ftargeted five restaurants, a children's
OL,12,Fnursery twice, a community centre and a
OL,13,Fplaycentre in the Leicester area.
OL,15,FFootage showed the 43-year-old, of no
OL,16,Ffixed address, trying to conceal his
OL,17,Fidentity with various hats, falling
OL,18,Fover at one point and trying to cover a
OL,19,FCCTV camera.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
