OL,3,GNEWSABurglar jailed after CCTV linked
OL,4,Ahim to crime spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FTulley was jailed on Thursday at
OL,7,FLeicester Crown Court for two years and
OL,8,Ffour months after pleading guilty to
OL,9,Fsix counts of burglary, two of
OL,10,Fattempted burglary and two of damaging
OL,11,Fproperty.
